<title>UK: Greenalls details 25 mln stg Pubco bond buy-back.</title>
<headline>Greenalls details 25 mln stg Pubco bond buy-back.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greenalls Group Plc has bought back 25 million stg of the 11.25 percent Pubco bond due 2006 at yield spreads ranging down to 40 basis points over gilts, Greenalls said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>All offers over 40 b.p. were accepted in full and offers at 40 b.p. were accepted at around 21.68 percent, Greenalls said.</p>
<p>The Boddington Group, a Greenalls' subsidiary, is repaying 25 million stg advanced to it by Pubco.</p>
<p>There was 111 million stg of the 2006 deal outstanding.</p>
<p>The buy-back was announced on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
</text>
